{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの更新に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさいm(._.)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ayane.suzuki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ayane.suzuki/img/2015/04/24/6858280/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ\nお越し下さった皆さん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCなしのノンストップライブ\nお楽しみいただけましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハーサルでは\nアレンジを加えた振り付けを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えるのに苦戦しましたが\nこの期間でダンススキルが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"格段にアップしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パフォーマンスを向上させる為の\n課題もたくさん見つけました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから1つ1つ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリアしていきたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーメンバー全員で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽を迎えることができたのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのおかげです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブに関わって下さった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全ての皆さんに感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ayane.suzuki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ayane.suzuki/img/2015/04/24/6858280/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n千秋楽の朗読でも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お話させていただきましたが\n5月から上京することになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで、家族や友人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの人に支えてもらいながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"活動を続けてきたので\nこれから始まる東京での生活は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直不安です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、自分で選んだ道を信じ\n私を支え、応援してくれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方に恩返しができるよう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ayane.suzuki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ayane.suzuki/img/2015/04/24/6858280/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鈴木絢音"}],"source":"archive"}